   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to legalize, validate, ratify and confirm certain actions of the Candor Fire District and the village of Candor relating to their provision of fire protection services within the territorial boundaries of the village of Candor, and authorizing the creation of a joint fire district",
    "basePrintNo": "S5951",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5951-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Villages",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5951\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to legalize, validate, ratify and confirm\ncertain actions of the Candor Fire District and the village of Candor\nrelating to their provision of fire protection services within the\nterritorial boundaries of the village of Candor, and authorizing the\ncreation of a joint fire district\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nTo validate the proceedings and actions of the Candor Fire District\nand the Village of Candor relating to their provision of fire\nprotection services within the territorial boundaries of the Village\nof Candor, and authorizing the creation of a joint fire district.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection 1 provides that any actions of the Candor Fire District and\nthe Village of Candor relating to their provision of fire protection\nservices within the territorial boundaries of the Village of Candor\nfrom 2007 to present are hereby validated and ratified.\n\nSection 2 authorizes the inclusion of the territorial boundaries of\nthe Village of Candor within the boundaries of the Candor Fire\nDistrict without further authorization or approval by any municipal\nentity.\n\nSection 3 provides the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThe Candor Fire District and the Village of Candor, each a subdivision\nof the state located within the Town of Candor, Tioga County, in 2007\nagreed to the creation of a joint fire district that would include the\nareas then protected separately by the Candor Fire District and the\nVillage of Candor. Despite operating under the belief that a joint\nfire district had been created, the procedure for creation of a joint\nfire district was not properly followed through error or omission. As\na result, residents of the Village of Candor have been taxed as\nresidents of the Candor Fire District without proper authorization.\nThe legislation validates the Candor Fire District and the Village of\nCandor's actions during the period of January 1, 2007 through present\nrelated to fire protection services, and authorizes the inclusion of\nthe territorial boundaries of the Village of Candor within the\nboundary of the Candor Fire District.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediate.\n",
