   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to legalize, validate, ratify and confirm certain actions of the Candor Fire District and the village of Candor relating to their provision of fire protection services within the territorial boundaries of the village of Candor, and authorizing the creation of a joint fire district",
    "basePrintNo": "S5951",
